      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Slow down and split the fraction into two groups.\n\nNumerators: 1, 5, 2, 4 → L.C.M. = 20\n\nDenominators: 3, 6, 9, 27 → H.C.F. = 3\n\nSo:\n\nL.C.M. = 20/3\n\nThe common mistake is reversing the two operations.",
