    "fraction_sanity": {
      "id": "fraction_sanity",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Look at the structure of the two worked examples.\n\nThe H.C.F. formula is always the same. Only the lists of numerators and denominators change.\n\nThis means the safest habit is to write the formula first and substitute the two lists underneath it.",
