        "text": "Separate the two calculations:\n\nL.C.M.(2,3,4,9) = 36\n\nH.C.F.(3,5,7,13) = 1\n\nTherefore:\n\n36/1 = 36\n\nThe denominator does not create a new factor because its H.C.F. is 1.",
