      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Apply the formula exactly:\n\nL.C.M. = L.C.M.(numerators) / H.C.F.(denominators)\n\nSo:\n\nL.C.M.(3,6,9) = 18\nH.C.F.(4,7,8) = 1\n\nAnswer = 18.",
